teradatasql>=20.0.0.66  # 20.0.0.66 is the first release built with the Go 1.26.6 toolchain, which resolves every remaining HIGH/CRITICAL in the daily scan: CVE-2026-39821 (9.6 CRITICAL), CVE-2026-56862, CVE-2026-56859, CVE-2026-56853, CVE-2026-46600, CVE-2026-33818 — all golang/stdlib, all fixed in 1.26.6. Bump on the *toolchain*, not the release number: 20.0.0.65 looked newer but was still Go 1.26.5, inside the affected range. Verify with `grep -aoE 'go1\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+'` over the wheel's bundled binaries; all ten (.so/.dll/.dylib) report go1.26.6

